  "2026-10-22T16:15:54.220Z",codex-agent,"Counterfactual implementation encountered the same ambient extension SDK skew again: the pinned 2026.10.17 host reports extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew against a global pm-github runtime using 2026.10.22. No project-managed extension is installed in this worktree. Strict health passes with an isolated HOME and global Git configuration disabled, matching a clean CI environment; history integrity also passes. Kept dependency pins and global installations unchanged. Reused this existing follow-up rather than creating a duplicate."
  "2026-10-23T18:00:25.598Z",codex-agent,"Partial-receipt verification reproduced this known ambient host/managed-extension skew with pinned pm-cli 2026.10.20 and a pm-github runtime using 2026.10.23. No project-managed extension is installed. Strict health with isolated HOME and disabled global/system Git configuration passes (exit 0), including history integrity, matching a clean CI environment. Reused this follow-up; dependency pins and shared installations remain unchanged. Related implementation evidence is in pm-jev-w1zj, whose npm and Bun release gates each passed 323/323 at 100% coverage."
  "2026-10-27T09:10:37.050Z",codex-agent,"PR #50 delivers calibration drift diagnostics, not a proof that managed-extension host-version skew is repaired. Retain this issue open pending independent host-provisioning and strict-health verification. Reviewed merged PR #50 (478e335a43889726324358d0102d2a6471605906)."
  "2026-10-29T00:48:39.114Z",codex-agent,"Label-queue feature verification re-observed the existing strict-health managed-extension mismatch: package host 2026.10.25 versus pm-github host 2026.10.28. All other ten-check health dimensions passed, including history drift. No SDK pin, managed extension provisioning, telemetry or unrelated settings were changed. Companion feature evidence is pm-jev-h8hx; fresh CI health remains the isolated-clone authority."
